OL,3,GNEWSAInjured adventurers saved by
OL,4,Amountain rescue team
OL,5,
OL,6,FMountain rescuers in the Peak District
OL,7,Fwere called to two emergencies in the
OL,8,Fspace of an hour at the weekend.
OL,10,FEdale Mountain Rescue Team said the
OL,11,Fambulance service asked for its
OL,12,Fassistance at Burbage Valley at 16:19
OL,13,FBST on Sunday after a boulderer
OL,14,Fsuffered a head injury in a fall.
OL,16,FThe climber was given medical treatment
OL,17,Fat the scene before being moved to an
OL,18,Fambulance and taken to hospital.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
