OL,3,GNEWSAInjured adventurers saved by
OL,4,Amountain rescue team
OL,5,
OL,6,FThen at 17:15, the team was called to
OL,7,FHooks Carr at Stanage Edge where a
OL,8,Fwalker had suffered a medical episode
OL,9,Fand collapsed on the track just below
OL,10,Fthe edge.
